{"synopsis":"Dunia telah berakhir.\nSebuah alam yang dilahap oleh kematian dan keputusasaan.\n\nDan pria yang bertarung hingga akhir—Dewa Pedang, Karserian Le Vandein.\n\nNamun seolah dituntun oleh takdir, sebuah gerbang menuju dunia lain terbuka.\nDi baliknya terhampar Bumi, masih murni, tak tersentuh kehancuran.\n\nNamun di sana, monster mulai bermunculan, dan umat manusia hidup tanpa sadar akan bencana yang mengintai.\n\nDunia ini belum sepenuhnya hilang.\nNamun, kejadian mengerikan di masa lalu akan terulang—kecuali seseorang menghentikannya.\n\nUntuk mencegah masa depan itu, Dewa Pedang mengangkat pedangnya sekali lagi.\n\nMeminjam tubuh seorang manusia lemah, ia memulai kehidupan baru.\nSebagai gantinya, ia membuat satu janji:\n\n\"Aku akan melindungi keluargamu.\"\n\nDan kini, kisah yang sesungguhnya pun dimulai.","alternative_title":"멸망한 세계에서 온 검신","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"ddc118ad-1247-4d75-949a-62502f8d7139","date":"2026-03-04","images":[]},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"7a915d70-fac8-4467-b3a0-03dd241c67d3","date":"2026-02-25","images":[]},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"c66b62e0-f45d-4db4-9616-7e0a58d38dcb","date":"2026-02-18","images":[]},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"d637047c-5a71-439a-8d05-4a4dde6242ee","date":"2026-01-28","images":[]},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"427ef0a9-5f75-4c2f-906e-9b67da341c3f","date":"2026-01-13","images":[]},{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"2e9dce5e-2f46-4ebd-9aa7-f7fdb33f5e80","date":"2026-01-06","images":[]},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"b45caa6c-527f-4d9b-8b9f-270a21429943","date":"2025-12-30","images":[]},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"31a12426-70e6-4998-88c1-08bcf52a3297","date":"2025-12-16","images":[]},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"ac2fe271-cd24-4e04-b990-d06cf45bbec1","date":"2025-12-09","images":[]},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"eade53e3-092b-48b7-ae3c-140ea989746c","date":"2025-12-02","i